native-config-inheritance

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Allow machine-local config files to inherit one explicit parent chain.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream provides equivalent recursive config inheritance with source-aware diagnostics and child-only writes.
